goats, sun fish, squid, and many more!\n\nMajor Updates:\nAugust 2026: new highly immersive swimming areas with the option to swim using hand swimming movements for hand tracking, controllers, or joystick\n", "short_description": "- This is a relaxing zoo experience with over 140 high detailed animals to see and 60 jungle plants.\n- Immersive swimming areas with hand swimming\n- Mixed reality and handtracking areas allow you to create a zoo home along with jungle environments.\n- ZOSU Zoo VR Land & 30 ZOSU Ocean VR levels are waiting for you in classic VR.\n\nAnimals include: lions, sharks, dinosaurs, clown fish, pre-historic fish, elephants, whales, crocodiles, tigers, octopus, whales, dolphins, horses, cats, dogs, and more."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://zosustudios.wixsite.com/website/about", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://zosustudios.wixsite.com/website/about", "publisher_name": "ZOSU Studios LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.zosustudios.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "DINOSAURS", "ADVENTURE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26305612335802945"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499627502_2128976987754687_3530743161940298158_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100